  "body": "## What changed\n\nDovetail cutters (`ToolKind::Dovetail`) now read `corner_r` across geometry, verification, stock simulation, and the UI:\n\n- `crates/tools/src/undercut.rs`: `Head::Dove` stores `{ cot, corner_r }`. `Undercut::rho` evaluates the corner arc up to `s_tan = c * (1 + sin t)` and the tangent flank above `s_tan`. `Undercut::contact()` returns `(r, corner_r)`.\n- `crates/tools/src/undercut.rs`: `undercut::refusal` checks `corner_r` in `[0, diameter / 2]`, `s_tan <= flute_len + NECK_MEETS`, and neck clearance against the rounded flank.\n- `crates/tools/src/undercut.rs` and `crates/tools/src/meridian.rs`: `head_outline` and `Tool::meridian` emit the rounded corner arc and straight flank.\n- `crates/sim/src/verify/`: `Cutter::atoms` emits `Prof::Zone` (`[0, s_tan]`) and `Prof::Dove` (`[s_tan, flute_len]`), or one `Prof::Zone` when the flank top meets `s_tan`. `swept::rho_expanded` and `rotary_geom::shapes` handle `Prof::Zone`. `Frame` moves to `probe_frame.rs` under the 400-line rule.\n- `crates/sim/src/stock_sim/`: `SdfTool::Dovetail` and `RevKind::Dove` add `corner: f64`. `field_dove::dove_dist` computes the exact Euclidean SDF of the rounded dovetail head.\n- `crates/ui/src/egui_app/`: `tool_settings_grid`, `tool_summary`, `tool_cutter_params`, and `tool_undercut_row::seed` show and preserve `Corner radius` for `ToolKind::Dovetail`, while keeping it hidden and zeroed for `TSlot`, `Keyseat`, and `Lollipop`.\n- `docs/decisions/4004-dovetail-corner-radius.md`: records the unattended design decisions.\n\n## Readings\n\nFor the `#4004` dovetail cutter (`diameter = 19.05 mm`, `tip_angle = 60 deg`, `flute_len = 9.525 mm`, `shank_d = 8.0 mm`):\n\n- `corner_r = 0.0 mm`: top radius is `4.026 mm` (`contact = (9.525, 0.0)`). The 24 mm wide, 30 deg slot verifies clean and posts.\n- `corner_r = 0.254 mm`: top radius is `4.212 mm` (`+0.186 mm` wider; `contact = (9.525, 0.254)`). The 24 mm slot catches `Warning::Gouge` and holds the post.\n- `corner_r = 3.0 mm`: top radius is `6.222 mm` (`+2.196 mm` wider; `contact = (9.525, 3.0)`). The 24 mm slot catches `Warning::Gouge` and holds the post, and field stock removes the wider flank and rounded bottom corner.\n\n## Screenshots\n\nOff-screen renders (`egui_kittest`, headless `wgpu`, 1440 x 1100 px) show tool `DT-1905-60` (dovetail, diameter 19.05 mm, flank angle 60 deg, flutes 9.525 mm, shank 8.0 mm, `corner_r = 1.0 mm`) across the three changed UI surfaces.\n\n| Surface | Before (`baad348f1`) | After (`e2f674ee3`) |\n|---|---|---|\n| Properties summary | ![before](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mkinney/Camcraft/49847668c9153a8120102476b27bce0cd29660b2/4009/before-1-properties-summary.png) | ![after](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mkinney/Camcraft/49847668c9153a8120102476b27bce0cd29660b2/4009/after-1-properties-summary.png) |\n| Tool editor (Tool library window) | ![before](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mkinney/Camcraft/49847668c9153a8120102476b27bce0cd29660b2/4009/before-2-tool-editor.png) | ![after](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mkinney/Camcraft/49847668c9153a8120102476b27bce0cd29660b2/4009/after-2-tool-editor.png) |\n| Draw cutter (Tool shape, Profile tab) | ![before](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mkinney/Camcraft/49847668c9153a8120102476b27bce0cd29660b2/4009/before-3-draw-cutter.png) | ![after](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mkinney/Camcraft/49847668c9153a8120102476b27bce0cd29660b2/4009/after-3-draw-cutter.png) |\n\n## Verification (head `e2f674ee307decb56b58159ebf5a7bb54f604154`)\n\nAll verification ran in software and simulation tests (not on a mill):\n\n- `cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main`: all 899 planned steps passed (`8,798 passed, 0 failed, 146 ignored` across `tools`, `sim`, `motion`, `app`, `ui`, after resolving one transient `agie_native` Windows file-lock `os error 5` on retry and clearing stale seeded `serde_spanned`/`toml`/`kittest`/`accesskit_consumer` units for `ui`).\n  - `tools` (2 suites): 156 passed, 0 failed, 0 ignored (`a_rounded_dovetail_reads_its_corner_radius_and_widened_flank`, `a_dovetail_corner_radius_refusals_name_the_rule`).\n  - `sim` (79 suites): 820 passed, 0 failed, 3 ignored (`a_lifted_dovetail_corner_zone_is_never_grown_smaller_than_its_solid`, `the_dovetail_distance_matches_a_dense_boundary_reference`, `a_rounded_dovetail_flank_gouges_the_24mm_slot_and_cuts_wider_in_field_stock`, `a_rounded_dovetail_keeps_clearance_on_its_corner_and_flank`).\n  - `motion` (99 suites): 1,404 passed, 0 failed, 70 ignored (`a_rounded_dovetail_shifts_by_its_widest_corner_and_keeps_z_at_station`, `golden_undercut`).\n  - `app` (705 suites): 4,711 passed, 0 failed, 65 ignored (`a_dovetail_corner_radius_catches_the_24mm_slot_gouge_and_holds_the_post`, `example_catalog*`).\n  - `ui` (9 suites): 1,707 passed, 0 failed, 8 ignored (`dovetail_properties_and_editor_edit_flank_angle_and_corner_radius`, `switching_from_bull_nose_to_dovetail_keeps_valid_corner_r_and_clears_oversized_one`).\n- `cargo clippy -j 6 -p camcraft-tools -p camcraft-sim -p camcraft-motion -p camcraft-app -p camcraft-ui --all-targets -- -D warnings`: pass (exit 0).\n- `cargo xtask gate light`: 6 steps, 0 failed, 0 stalled (11 light twins passed).\n- Targeted `P1` safety-floor heavy check: `cargo xtask gate heavy --base upstream/main --dry-run` reached 107 steps (`motion heavy` 30, `app heavy` 76, `kernel heavy` 8 skipped; `camcraft-sim` has no heavy lane). Inspection of `tools`, `sim`, `motion`, and `app` confirmed zero `#[ignore]`d dovetail or undercut heavy tests exist; every undercut and dovetail suite ran and passed in `quick`.\n- `git merge-tree --write-tree upstream/main e2f674ee3`: clean (exit 0); no golden files or snapshot PNGs changed.\n\n## Not exercised\n\n- Remaining heavy-lane steps outside undercut/dovetail code (deferred to the cut gate) and physical mill runs (verification ran in software/tests, not on a mill).\n\nfork synced at v0.26.0\nChangelog: Dovetail cutters read corner_r across undercut geometry, gouge verification, field stock simulation, and the tool editor.\nEffort: high\n\nFixes #4004",
